{"action_ordinal":3,"episode_id":"r1ep-9d39ce078274be1d76498c056e6a63df","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0003","observation_sha256":"ea4002fd2633ac6418e84a88cf346463c9ca794e30c0b380b3276d917d720818","ordinal":3,"provider_round":2,"question_sha256":"d82f866ed4dae0737c5928734f3adb500944fad9cfea49678606cb643f3b56eb","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":3,"episode_id":"r1ep-9d39ce078274be1d76498c056e6a63df","key_id":"84257c5ffcfd1e3733a6e65fb3145e0d27934ae2f0bfde73da9d03740cad85da","ordinal":3,"provider_round":2,"question_sha256":"d82f866ed4dae0737c5928734f3adb500944fad9cfea49678606cb643f3b56eb","receipt_mac":"150c845a3a8582ab8b24987b84065a7092bfa1f4857cb7d865d32125ed141680","result_sha256":"9644a4636d7521eb370331db4f1b1b668a9a60cdec8595262c9e696ae9156619","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"cdefb759f83249b7cd5b9fe703c46e5be887ecde0f8a61f33260f2d8a74f6627"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"case_sensitive":false,"max_results":80,"path":"/memories","pattern":"album"},"content":"/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-05.md:L46: Dave: If I'm having trouble coming up with ideas, I usually immerse myself in something I love, like concerts or my favorite albums. Doing that usually helps to jumpstart my inspiration. Maybe try taking a break from music and explore other things. Plus, have some fun while you're at it!\n/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-28.md:L12: Calvin: Hey Dave! It's been a while! Crazy stuff has been happening. Last week I threw a small party at my Japanese house for my new album. It was amazing, so much love from my fam and friends! Take a look at the photo of the party in the mansion, it was so energizing!\n/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-28.md:L16: Dave: Congrats on your album release and the party, Calvin! Must've been a great feeling having your loved ones show their support.\n/memories/music-and-performance/session-16.md:L29: Calvin: Cool! Last weekend I started shooting a video for my new album - can't wait for you to check it out! Look how great it was!\n/memories/music-and-performance/session-18.md:L12: Calvin: Hey Dave! Sorry it took me so long to get back to you. Crazy times since we talked! My album finally dropped on the 11th and it was a wild feeling. Everyone's been loving it and it's motivated me to keep going.\n/memories/music-and-performance/session-18.md:L15: Dave: Hey Calvin! Congrats on your album release - that's awesome! Has it been overwhelming or inspiring?\n/memories/photography/session-27.md:L44: Calvin: That's awesome, Dave! Your car project sounds amazing. I've had some great collaborations recently and my album is almost finished. I'll send you some previews soon. Let me know when you're free for a catch-up.\n/memories/travel-and-outdoors/session-08.md:L12: Calvin: Hey Dave! Met with the creative team for my album yesterday. It was a long session, but awesome to see everything coming together. \n/memories/travel-and-outdoors/session-08.md:L15: Dave: Hey Cal! Sounds great that your album's coming along. Are you feeling good about it? Here's a pic I just took.\n/memories/travel-and-outdoors/session-08.md:L19: Calvin: Dave, thanks for checking in. I'm feeling stoked about this album! We've been making some magic with a team in the studio, working on the music and everything. Look at what a wonderful studio we have! How have you been? Anything new since we talked?","content_sha256":"7229a144e914f9f22e3894161ea80805408cae6cc6f24e03bbfec61647c41348","coverage":[{"line_end":46,"line_start":46,"path":"/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-05.md"},{"line_end":12,"line_start":12,"path":"/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-28.md"},{"line_end":16,"line_start":16,"path":"/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-28.md"},{"line_end":29,"line_start":29,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-16.md"},{"line_end":12,"line_start":12,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-18.md"},{"line_end":15,"line_start":15,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-18.md"},{"line_